   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">Hi all,</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">I&#39;m glad to participate in this community group!</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">I have two questions in the analysis.</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35);min-height:21px\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\"></span><br></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35);min-height:21px\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\"></span><br></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">&lt;Q1&gt;</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">In the output result of standardizedSolution (object = fitxxx),</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">I understand that </span>observation variable X1~~X1 means error <span>variance</span> of X1.</p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">What does X1~1 mean?</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35);min-height:21px\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\"></span><br></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">&gt; standardizedSolution(object= fitxxx)</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">　　　lhs op rhs  est.std    se    z 　　pvalue</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">/////////</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">23    X1 ~~  X1   1.000 0.603  1.658  0.097</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">/////////</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">39   X1~    1     1.507 0.173  8.711  0.000</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35);min-height:21px\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\"></span><br></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35);min-height:21px\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\"></span><br></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35);min-height:21px\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\"></span><br></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">&lt;Q2&gt;</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">I set an error correlation between observation variable X1 and X2 (X1~~X2) and analyze (the model included ten observation variables). However, the cfi of the model reached only about 0.89.</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">So I tried the following,</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">   MI &lt;-modificationIndices (fitxxx)</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">   subset (MI, mi&gt; 3)</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">As a result, It was better to add the unidirectional path(X1~X2).</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\">Certainly, adding this path raises cfi to 0.98, but does it matter if both error correlations (X1~X2) and unidirectional paths (X1~~X2) are included at the same time?　I have never seen such a model.</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35);min-height:21px\"><span style=\"font-kerning:none\"></span><br></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;color:rgb(35,35,35)\"><br></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;min-height:21px\"><br></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;min-height:21px\"><br></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;min-height:21px\"><br></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;;min-height:21px\"><br></p></div>"
