     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font size=\"4\">The warning message was below. The model normally converged and SEs could be calculated.　<br></font></div><div><span lang=\"en\"><font size=\"4\">It may be because the paths extends from five observed variables to X1 and X2 (</font></span><span style=\"font-size:large\">I do not understand it well </span><span style=\"font-size:large\">)?</span></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:14.15pt;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\00660e\\00671d  Pro W3&quot;;color:blue\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:14.15pt;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\00660e\\00671d  Pro W3&quot;;color:blue\"><font size=\"2\">lavaan WARNING: some observed variances are\r\n(at least) a factor 1000 times larger than others; use varTable(fit) to\r\ninvestigate<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:14.15pt;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\00660e\\00671d  Pro W3&quot;;color:blue\"><font size=\"2\">&gt;\r\nsummary(fitxxx, standardized=TRUE, fit.measure=TRUE)<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:14.15pt;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\00660e\\00671d  Pro W3&quot;;color:blue\"><font size=\"2\">lavaan\r\n(0.5-22) converged normally after 140 iterations</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:14.15pt;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\00660e\\00671d  Pro W3&quot;;color:blue\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:14.15pt;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\00660e\\00671d  Pro W3&quot;;color:blue\"><font size=\"2\"><span>   </span>cfi<span>    　</span>rmsea<span>      </span>gfi<span>     </span><u></u><u></u></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:14.15pt;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\00660e\\00671d  Pro W3&quot;;color:blue\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:14.15pt;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\00660e\\00671d  Pro W3&quot;;color:blue\"><font size=\"2\"><span>   </span>0.981<span>   \r\n</span>0.034<span>    </span>0.995<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n</div><div><font size=\"2\"> <br></font></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\00660e\\00671d  Pro W3&quot;;color:blue\"><font size=\"4\">&quot;est.std&quot;  </font></span><span style=\"font-size:large;color:blue;font-family:&quot;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\00660e\\00671d  Pro W3&quot;\">were below.</span></div><div><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:blue;font-family:&quot;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\00660e\\00671d  Pro W3&quot;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">X1</span>~~</span>X2   <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:blue;font-family:&quot;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\00660e\\00671d  Pro W3&quot;\"> 0.77</span><br></font></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:blue;font-family:&quot;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\00660e\\00671d  Pro W3&quot;\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">X1</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> ~</span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">X2   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">  -0.91</span>   </font><br></span></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div><font size=\"4\"><span lang=\"en\">According to your advice, </span></font><span style=\"font-size:large\">the model</span><span style=\"font-size:large\">  and </span><span style=\"font-size:large\">the calculation result are special. </span></div><div><font size=\"4\"><span lang=\"en\"><span>Is it better not to adopt this model?</span></span><br></font></div></div>"
